  "description": "Strict JWT validation with Base64url malleability protection.\n      Detects and prevents token mutation via non-canonical Base64url encoding.\n      Prevents token revocation bypass, session fixation, and audit trail corruption.\n      Supports .NET 8.0 (LTS) and .NET 10.0+.",
